--
--   **Context.** The round-six complex network in the item-language gate class (`GClassH`)
--
--   `R6CxNetFinal.net` uses `mergedChunk` (an opaque `Classical.choose` of `merge_chunk`) for its frame
--   changes; its steps cannot be inspected. `netG` is the same network with every merged chunk replaced by
--   the explicit `chunkH` (row additions, one child, row additions) chosen from `merge_identity`: same
--   denotation, same child widths. Its only gates are the chunk gates `GOp.mat`:
--
--   * `z_d += (k/2) z_s` with `d ≠ s` (all local ops, `C1`, `C2`): `|k|` KFG atoms `(d, s, sign k, h = 1)`;
--   * `z_X += -2 z_X` (`C3`): the `±1` diagonal `-1` at `X`.
--
--   **`cxNetR6G : ∃ T (J : Prop8IfaceH 207387136 T 576 Jain.cxR6) A, GClassH J A`.**
